{"id":"z12-11","volume":12,"volumeTitle":"汉纪四","volumeSubtitle":"前189","index":11,"title":{"t":"惠帝六年","s":"惠帝六年"},"book":{"t":"資治通鑑","s":"资治通鉴"},"sourceHead":{"t":"漢紀四 · 前189 · 壬子","s":"汉纪四 · 前189 · 壬子"},"author":"司马光","annotated":true,"paragraphs":[{"sentences":[{"tr":"冬天十月，任命王陵为右丞相，陈平为左丞相。","tokens":[{"t":"冬","s":"冬","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"十","s":"十","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"月","s":"月","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"以","s":"以","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"王","s":"王","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"陵","s":"陵","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"為","s":"为","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"右","s":"右","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"丞","s":"丞","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"相","s":"相","py":"xiàng","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"陳","s":"陈","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"平","s":"平","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"為","s":"为","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"左","s":"左","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"丞","s":"丞","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"相","s":"相","py":"xiàng","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]}]},{"sentences":[{"tr":"齐悼惠王刘肥去世。","tokens":[{"t":"齊","s":"齐","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"悼","s":"悼","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"惠","s":"惠","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"王","s":"王","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"肥","s":"肥","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"薨","s":"薨","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]}]},{"sentences":[{"tr":"夏天，留文成侯张良去世。","tokens":[{"t":"夏","s":"夏","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"留","s":"留","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"文","s":"文","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"成","s":"成","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"侯","s":"侯","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"張","s":"张","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"良","s":"良","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"薨","s":"薨","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]}]},{"sentences":[{"tr":"任命周勃为太尉。","tokens":[{"t":"以","s":"以","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"周","s":"周","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"勃","s":"勃","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"為","s":"为","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"太","s":"太","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"尉","s":"尉","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]}]}],"lesson":{"background":"汉惠帝六年，前189年。按照高帝的遗嘱，以王陵为右丞相，陈平为左丞相。齐悼惠王刘肥去世。夏天留侯张良去世。周勃任太尉。","theme":"高帝临终安排的人事在这一年一一落实：王陵、陈平为相，周勃掌兵。汉初的元老相继凋零，张良的去世标志着开国一代谋臣的退场。","technique":"本年仅四句，平铺直叙，人事任免和元老去世并列，不着一字评论，却让人看到开国一代谢幕、新的权力格局形成，体现编年体简要而有分量的风格。","keyContentWords":[{"word":"丞相","reading":"chéng xiàng","note":"辅佐皇帝的最高行政长官。此时分设左右丞相，汉以右为尊。"},{"word":"太尉","reading":"tài wèi","note":"掌管军事的最高长官。"}],"keyFunctionWords":[{"word":"以……为","reading":"yǐ wéi","note":"「以王陵为右丞相」，任命……做……。"}],"ancientModern":[{"word":"右","note":"汉代以右为尊，右丞相地位高于左丞相，和今天的习惯不同。"}],"phoneticLoans":[],"flexibleUsage":[],"specialSyntax":[{"name":"省略句","note":"「以周勃为太尉」，省略主语（朝廷）。"}]}}
